{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_you_might_not_need_an_effect", "label": "You might not need an effect", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/06-you-might-not-need-an-effect/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Effects are an escape hatch. If there is no external system, you should not need an Effect."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_two_principles", "label": "Transform during render; handle events in handlers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/06-you-might-not-need-an-effect/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An Effect has lost the information about what caused it. That is the defining property that makes effects wrong for event logic."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_twelve_cases", "label": "Twelve cases; only fetching survives", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/06-you-might-not-need-an-effect/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cases 1\u20134 are Phase 3 state-shape. Case 12 is a legitimate effect that still prefers a framework or cache. That ratio is the point."}, {"id": "docs_react_pages_phase_4_effects_06_you_might_not_need_an_effect_readme_displayed_vs_interaction", "label": "Displayed versus interaction test", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/react/pages/phase-4-effects/06-you-might-not-need-an-effect/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Code that runs because a component was displayed belongs in Effects; the